    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91df1fca8905ed5593c11a0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在『大阪杯』的出赛名单中，\n赫然有着去年制霸『皋月赏』与『日本德比』的\n二冠赛马娘，新宇宙的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30de6bbcfb475d30ab437ef095b735cedd9272fa14d24821f6bf2d45650c9e28",
